emblies, clad and precious metal pre-forms, and high temperature braze materials. Further, the company designs and manufactures precision thin film coatings, optical filters, and assemblies. In addition, it offers inorganic chemicals and powders, specialty coatings, specialty engineered beryllium and copper-based alloys, beryllium composites, ceramics, and engineered clad and plated metal systems. The company sells its products to semiconductor, industrial, aerospace and defense, automotive, energy, consumer electronics, and life sciences through its facilities and service centers, independent distributors and agents, outside distributors, direct sales offices, and independent sales representatives. The company was formerly known as Brush Engineered Materials Inc. and changed its name to Materion Corporation in March 2011. Materion Corporation was founded in 1921 and is based in Mayfield Heights, Ohio.","employees":3000,"website":"https://materion.com","country":"United States","city":"Mayfield Heights","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","title":"CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Shelly M. Chadwick","title":"CFO & VP of Finance"},{"name":"Mr. Gregory R. Chemnitz","title":"VP, General Counsel & Secretary"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":11.76,"tpe":18.04,"ps":2.219,"pfcf":22.2,"peg":1.72,"pb":2.432,"ev_ebitda":8.96,"rev_growth":0.158,"eps_growth":0.466,"eps_growth_fwd":0.3282,"eps_growth_next":0.1475,"div_yield":0.0088,"roe":0.1295,"roa":0.06954,"de":45.45,"gross_margin":0.3321,"op_margin":0.1691,"profit_margin":0.07628,"current_ratio":2.086},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":20.83,"sector":11.76,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":36.0,"sector":18.04,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.652,"sector":2.219,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":58.37,"sector":22.2,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.28,"sector":1.72,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"